{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.GCTPerRankObstruction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.GCTPerRankObstruction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Information.GCTSchurMultiplicity"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.schur_obstruction_all_ranks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.schur_obstruction_all_ranks","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/GCTPerRankObstruction.lean#L54-L61","doc":"**The obstruction shape at all ranks (sorry-free).**  Packaged as the\n`∀ n, ∃ λ` predicate the GCT program targets — here for the substrate-vs-TL\n*regime* separation.  This is the structural precedent, **not** a\n`QouGCTObstruction` instance (which requires the open `VP`-vs-`VNP` content). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.schur_per_rank_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.schur_per_rank_obstruction","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/GCTPerRankObstruction.lean#L44-L52","doc":"**Per-rank GCT multiplicity obstruction (sorry-free).**  For every `n ≥ 2`,\nthe size-`n` single-row partition `[n]` witnesses a `SeparatedAt` between the\nsubstrate multiplicity data (all blocks present) and the TL-locus data\n(content-`1` blocks dropped at `X = Q^{-1}`).  The multiplicity drop occurs at\n**every** rank. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.size_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.size_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/GCTPerRankObstruction.lean#L40-L42","doc":"`[n]` is a size-`n` partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.hasContentCell_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.hasContentCell_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/GCTPerRankObstruction.lean#L31-L38","doc":"**The single-row partition `[n]` has a content-`1` cell for `n ≥ 2`.**  Its\ncell `(0,1)` has content `1 − 0 = 1`; the column index `1` is in range\nbecause the row length `n ≥ 2`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}